    "title": "TimeCast Watch Face Lite",
    "description": "Experience the essential features of TimeCast without the premium price for Wear OS smartwatches.\r\n\r\nThe watch face is made with new watch face format (WFF).\r\n\r\n<b>Note:</b> TimeCast Lite offers a limited number of color themes and complications compared to the FULL version.\r\n\r\n<b>This watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API Level 30+ like Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, Galaxy Watch 5, Galaxy Watch 6, 7, Ultra, Pixel Watch etc.</b>\r\n\r\nTo get a FULL version of TimeCast check the link:\r\n\r\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=watch.richface.app.timecast.premium\r\n\r\n\u2605  Key Features:\r\n\r\n\u2714  Modern Design: Enjoy a sleek and stylish watch face design. \r\n\u2714 Essential Information at a Glance\r\n\u2714  Battery-Friendly Ambient Mode: Preserve your battery life with a clear display. \r\n\u2714  Sleek Design: Enhance your smartwatch's appearance with a modern aesthetic.\r\n\r\n- 12/24hr Digital Time\r\n- Date\r\n- Sunrise/Sunset\r\n- Events\r\n- Battery\r\n- Heart rate\r\n- Steps\r\n- Daily steps goal\r\n- Weather\r\n- 2 Preset app shortcuts\r\n- 1 customizable shortcut\r\n\r\nWatch Face Complications:\r\nYou can personalize it with any data you choose.\r\n\r\n\u2605\u2003<b>FAQ</b>\r\n!! Please contact us if you have any trouble with the app !! \r\nrichface.watch@gmail.com\r\n\r\n\u2605 PERMISSIONS Explained\r\nhttps://www.richface.watch/privacy",
